Package: katu-ia
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Katu OS Team <katuos@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt5 | python3-pyside6, katu-release
Recommends: python3-pip
Priority: optional
Section: misc
Description: Katu IA — AI Hub for developers
 Visual hub for AI-assisted development. Supports Claude (Anthropic),
 GPT-4 (OpenAI), Gemini (Google) and Ollama (local models).
 Includes 12 developer prompt templates and shell AI functions:
 ai, ai-fix, ai-explain, ai-code, ai-review, ai-commit, ai-sql, ai-doc.
